  "description": "Map application message types and public static endpoint methods to MCP tools on the official C# SDK, or MapTool handlers. Deny-by-default catalog, typed McpResult, HTTP + opt-in stdio. Write idempotency (memory or distributed wait-and-replay with UseRedisLock). 2026 MRTR confirmation elicitation. Does not require BuildingBlocks.Mediator or BuildingBlocks.Idempotency.",
