  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0: UseDistributedIdempotency + UseRedisLock (RedisMcpIdempotencyLock over host IConnectionMultiplexer; wait-and-replay, not HTTP 409; lease is not exactly-once); custom IMcpIdempotencyLock still supported; 2026 MRTR confirmation via InputRequiredException elicitation (2025-11-25 stays ConfirmationRequired JSON). https://github.com/Maxofpower/FeatureFusion/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
